 "intro": "Formal result connectors, and the one of them that takes the subjunctive.",
 "palabras": [
  {
   "palabra": "de ahí que",
   "significado": "hence, that is why",
   "pron": "de a-I ke",
   "ipa": "",
   "cat": "set expression",
   "genero": "",
   "plural": "",
   "definida": "",
   "consejo": "It always takes the subjunctive: «de ahí que no venga». It is the exception among result connectors.",
   "nota": "",
   "oculta": false
  },
  {
   "palabra": "de modo que",
   "significado": "so; so that",
   "pron": "de MO-do ke",
   "ipa": "",
   "cat": "set expression",
   "genero": "",
   "plural": "",
   "definida": "",
   "consejo": "With the indicative it expresses a result; with the subjunctive, a purpose: «habla de modo que te oigan».",
   "nota": "",
   "oculta": false
  },
  {
   "palabra": "de manera que",
   "significado": "so; so that",
   "pron": "de ma-NE-ra ke",
   "ipa": "",
   "cat": "set expression",
   "genero": "",
   "plural": "",
   "definida": "",
   "consejo": "It works like «de modo que»: indicative for a result, subjunctive for a purpose.",
   "nota": "",
   "oculta": false
  },
  {
   "palabra": "por consiguiente",
   "significado": "consequently",
   "pron": "por kon-si-GYEN-te",
   "ipa": "",
   "cat": "set expression",
   "genero": "",
   "plural": "",
   "definida": "",
   "consejo": "It is formal and takes the indicative. It usually opens the sentence or sits between commas.",
   "nota": "",
   "oculta": false
  },
  {
   "palabra": "así pues",
   "significado": "so, thus",
   "pron": "a-SI pwes",
   "ipa": "",
   "cat": "set expression",
   "genero": "",
   "plural": "",
   "definida": "",
   "consejo": "It is more written than spoken. It opens a conclusion: «así pues, no iremos».",
   "nota": "",
   "oculta": false
  },
  {
   "palabra": "con lo cual",
   "significado": "which means that",
   "pron": "kon lo KWAL",
   "ipa": "",
   "cat": "set expression",
   "genero": "",
   "plural": "",
   "definida": "",
   "consejo": "It takes the indicative and picks up what came before: «perdí el tren, con lo cual llegué tarde».",
   "nota": "",
   "oculta": false
  },
  {
   "palabra": "hasta el punto de que",
   "significado": "to the point that",
   "pron": "AS-ta el PUN-to de ke",
   "ipa": "",
   "cat": "set expression",
   "genero": "",
   "plural": "",
   "definida": "",
   "consejo": "It expresses a very strong result and takes the indicative: «hasta el punto de que no pude dormir».",
   "nota": "",
   "oculta": false
  },
  {
   "palabra": "luego",
   "significado": "therefore (in logic)",
   "pron": "LWE-go",
   "ipa": "",
   "cat": "conjunction",
   "genero": "",
   "plural": "",
   "definida": "",
   "consejo": "As a logical connector it is «por tanto»: «pienso, luego existo». As an adverb, «later».",
   "nota": "",
   "oculta": false
  },
  {
   "palabra": "afueras",
   "significado": "outskirts",
   "pron": "a-FWE-ras",
   "ipa": "",
   "cat": "noun",
   "genero": "f",
   "plural": "",
   "definida": "",
